{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202694GZaF3uHZ1795399708.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>今日天氣提提你：</p><p></p><p>一股清勁至強風程度的偏東氣流正影響廣東沿岸。同時，一道廣闊雲帶覆蓋華南。<br/><br/>本港地區今日天氣預測:<br/>大致多雲，部分時間天色明朗，稍後有一兩陣雨。吹和緩至清勁東風，初時離岸及高地吹強風，風勢有時疾勁。<br/><br/>展望: 明日轉吹偏北風，天氣轉涼，初時雨勢較為頻密。星期三及星期四早晚清涼，市區最低氣溫在16度左右，新界再低兩三度。</p><p></p><p>今日天氣預告由專治屙嘔肚痛嘅李萬山脾胃丸帶俾你。</p><p></p><p>09:45 更新</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T02:35:16.886842+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":201,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T22:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T15:50:10.921788+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T02:28:33.013768+00:00","content_hash":"4a81793bf7eab894b668ea5f2b95a20a4d35d7afa84a42a0b353576a622a642b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T02:35:16.886842+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}